  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Labour Migration Governance and Ethical Recruitment Practices in Cote d&apos;Ivoire, Ghana, Nigeria.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The focus of this project will be to strengthen labour migration governance and address unethical recruitment practices in Ghana, C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire, and Nigeria to enhance migrant workers&#x2019; protection and rights-based labour pathways. The project will contribute to addressing instances of exploitative employment of migrant workers while building the capacity of government officials, public employment centres as well as PRA and employers to protect migrant workers&#x2019; rights and promote their access to decent work opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
